  Officer --> UC_ApproveAward
  Officer --> UC_DisburseEFT
  Officer --> UC_VerifyLedger

  %% Sub-Registrar Links
  SubRegistrar --> UC_PoAGate
  SubRegistrar --> UC_RevokePoA
  SubRegistrar --> UC_CheckEvasion

  %% System Links
